{"id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves.md","title":"Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层","display":"Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","aliases":["14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves"],"display":"Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_location":"IX.5 equation (1), printed 487–488; DjVu 249–250","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573e576a0d47c877\" href=\"?note=573e576a0d47c877\" title=\"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies\">14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IX.5 equation (1), printed 487–488; DjVu 249–250"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a> 的 locale；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal O(X)\">\\(L=\\mathcal O(X)\\)</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 为对象集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span> 时唯一箭头记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的载体属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_X\">\\(\\mathcal C_X\\)</span> 采用下式的完整范畴六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 始终是箭头子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_S:=\\{\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(f):f\\in S\\}\">\\(D_S:=\\{\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(f):f\\in S\\}\\)</span> 是它对应的对象下闭集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span> 时箭头严格编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>，不把箭头筛与对象子集混用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"573e576a0d47c877\" href=\"?note=573e576a0d47c877\" title=\"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies\">14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies</a> 的典范拓扑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_X:=|L|,\\qquad A_X:=\\{(a,b)\\in|L|^2\\mid a\\le b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_X:=|L|,\\qquad A_X:=\\{(a,b)\\in|L|^2\\mid a\\le b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_X:=\\bigl(O_X,A_X,((a,b)\\mapsto a),((a,b)\\mapsto b),(a\\mapsto(a,a)),(((b,c),(a,b))\\mapsto(a,c))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_X:=\\bigl(O_X,A_X,((a,b)\\mapsto a),((a,b)\\mapsto b),(a\\mapsto(a,a)),(((b,c),(a,b))\\mapsto(a,c))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C_X)=|L|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(a,b)=\\{(a,b)\\mid a\\le b\\},\\qquad1_a=(a,a),\\qquad(b,c)\\circ(a,b)=(a,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C_X)=|L|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(a,b)=\\{(a,b)\\mid a\\le b\\},\\qquad1_a=(a,a),\\qquad(b,c)\\circ(a,b)=(a,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_S:=\\{\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(f)\\mid f\\in S\\},\\qquad J_X(b):=\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}(b)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}(S,b)\\land\\bigvee_L D_S=b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_S:=\\{\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(f)\\mid f\\in S\\},\\qquad J_X(b):=\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}(b)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}(S,b)\\land\\bigvee_L D_S=b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_X,\\mathcal C_X),\\qquad J_X=\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X},\\qquad\\mathbf{Sh}(X):=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C_X,J_X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_X,\\mathcal C_X),\\qquad J_X=\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X},\\qquad\\mathbf{Sh}(X):=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C_X,J_X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.5 式 (1)，印刷 487–488，DjVu 249–250，定义 locale 的覆盖及层，并指出此拓扑是典范拓扑。对象下闭集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_S\">\\(D_S\\)</span> 与箭头筛 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{(a,b):a\\in D_S\\}\">\\(S=\\{(a,b):a\\in D_S\\}\\)</span> 逐一对应；本项保留箭头标签使它能直接传入<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a>/<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a>的站点签名。</p>\n<p>框架分配律给拉回稳定性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee D_S=b\">\\(\\bigvee D_S=b\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\le b\">\\(c\\le b\\)</span>，则逆像筛的源集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_S\\cap\\downarrow c\">\\(D_S\\cap\\downarrow c\\)</span>，其上确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>；局部性由上确界结合得到。可表预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(a)\">\\(y(a)\\)</span> 的相容族存在恰要求所有筛源对象小于等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>；在覆盖筛上这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\le a\">\\(b\\le a\\)</span>，所以所有可表预层都是层。反过来，若一个次典范拓扑把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\bigvee D_S\">\\(a=\\bigvee D_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(a)\">\\(y(a)\\)</span> 有唯一相容族，其粘合给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\le a\">\\(b\\le a\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=b\">\\(a=b\\)</span>。因此任意次典范拓扑均包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_X\">\\(J_X\\)</span>，证明所写典范性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"573e576a0d47c877","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的 locale；$L=\\mathcal O(X)$。以 $|L|$ 为对象集，$a\\le b$ 时唯一箭头记 $(a,b)$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"573e576a0d47c877","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 为 [[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]] 的典范拓扑。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$、$\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 采用 [[14-df-sieve]]；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}$ 采用 [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$、$\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 采用 [[14-df-sieve]]；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}$ 采用 [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fc