 D_S=b\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_X,\\mathcal C_X),\\qquad J_X=\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X},\\qquad\\mathbf{Sh}(X):=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C_X,J_X).","display":true},{"tex":"D_S","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{(a,b):a\\in D_S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee D_S=b","display":false},{"tex":"c\\le b","display":false},{"tex":"D_S\\cap\\downarrow c","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"y(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b\\le a","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\bigvee D_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"y(a)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\le a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\le b","display":false},{"tex":"a=b","display":false},{"tex":"J_X","display":false}],"bytes":2999,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves|Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]"},{"id":"4831e90790611a73","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-Grothendieck 拓扑斯；locale 及其层范畴见 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]、[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves|Definition — locale 的覆盖站点与层]]"},{"id":"3997a1696a1be702","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)$ 为 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的框架同态；$\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)$ 采用 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]。"},{"id":"0f04b1f6787215b0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 为 locale，$L=\\mathcal O(X)$，开集层见 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]；$1$ 为层范畴终对象，$y_Xa=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)$ 为 $a$ 的可表次终层，其唯一到 $1$ 的箭头记 $\\iota_a$。"},{"id":"288974bbe429c3b2","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的 locale；$\\mathbf2$ 是 [[14-df-frame]] 显式构造的两元素框架。$\\mathbf{Sh}(X)$ 见 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]，$\\mathrm{IsPoint}$ 见 [[14-df-topos-point]]。$\\mathrm{Funs}$ 见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]，自然同构见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。$P_X$ 是下式给出的所有几何点的数据集合；$\\sim_X$ 的定义域为 $P_X^2$。$\\mathrm{Pt}(X)$ 是 locale 点的集合，$P_X/{\\sim_X}$ 是几何点的同构类商集。"}],"outgoing":["2f8d75439f8e94de","3fcbbf29a7947555","e21364f5dcced9e7","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","573e576a0d47c877","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}